### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos/1

### 3. 1件を入れ替える
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Javaの復習をする",
  "detail": null,
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/todos/25

###
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/todos/27

###
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/todos/28

###
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/todos/29

###　追加
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos?category=就職活動

### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json

### 6. 自分のアプリの祝日API
GET http://localhost:8081/api/holidays

###
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### 7. 履歴書を作成する
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "履歴書を作成する",
  "category": "応募書類",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-17"
}

### 8. 志望企業を調べる
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "志望企業を調べる",
  "category": "企業研究",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-17"
}

### 9. 面接の自己紹介を練習する
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "面接の自己紹介を練習する",
  "category": "面接対策",
  "priority": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-17"
}

### 6. MCPの窓口を確かめる
POST http://localhost:8081/mcp

### 7. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8081/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "requests.http", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}